1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,258
Can you twirl like a snowflake?

2
00:00:03,508 --> 00:00:05,796
Stand up and sing with us!

3
00:00:07,196 --> 00:00:09,922
Wiggle your fingers up high!

4
00:00:10,521 --> 00:00:12,138
Snowflakes falling,

5
00:00:12,138 --> 00:00:13,387
soft and slow!

6
00:00:13,687 --> 00:00:15,937
Twirl around!

7
00:00:16,737 --> 00:00:18,516
Twirling, swirling,

8
00:00:18,516 --> 00:00:19,811
down they go!

9
00:00:21,711 --> 00:00:23,752
Five little snowflakes,

10
00:00:23,752 --> 00:00:25,480
dancing in the sky,

11
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:28,491
One fell on Pip's warm nose...

12
00:00:30,091 --> 00:00:30,691
Drip! Bye bye!

13
00:00:30,991 --> 00:00:31,714
Hee hee!

14
00:00:31,714 --> 00:00:33,818
Touch your nose and say drip!

15
00:00:37,118 --> 00:00:39,221
One little snowflake landed

16
00:00:39,221 --> 00:00:40,272
on a mitten,

17
00:00:40,572 --> 00:00:41,914
Cold and cosy,

18
00:00:41,914 --> 00:00:44,281
like a little white kitten!

19
00:00:44,881 --> 00:00:47,612
Now float down slowly, slowly,

20
00:00:47,612 --> 00:00:49,516
and sit down softly.

21
00:00:49,766 --> 00:00:51,939
Can you do it?

22
00:00:53,939 --> 00:00:55,555
Snowflakes falling,

23
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:56,804
soft and slow!

24
00:00:57,054 --> 00:00:58,579
Twirling, swirling,

25
00:00:58,579 --> 00:00:59,689
down they go!

26
00:01:00,489 --> 00:01:02,193
Share with a friend and

27
00:01:02,193 --> 00:01:04,357
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

28
00:01:04,857 --> 00:01:06,425
Watch the full story

29
